/*
 * The same sram0 as every Pi 5 image (tools/probes/rpi_5/rpi5_clear,
 * tools/probes/rpi5_display): 32 MiB from 0x200000, below 4 GiB, so the
 * mailbox's message buffer address fits its 32-bit word. Both images whose
 * mailbox calls this probe compares had this overlay, so the buffers sit in
 * the same region here. Zephyr's own mailbox driver (mbox0) stays disabled,
 * as bcm2712.dtsi has it: the board layer's rpi_mbox.c owns the mailbox.
 */
&sram0 {
	reg = <0x0 0x200000 0x2000000>;
};
